WEBVTT

NOTE Actual app components with demonstration data. No real sends.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Partial then full payment — demonstration

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:14.303
When money arrives, find the invoice and record the amount and date received.

2
00:00:14.303 --> 00:00:24.385
A partial payment leaves the remaining balance open.

3
00:00:24.385 --> 00:00:34.129
Record the next installment when it arrives.

4
00:00:34.129 --> 00:00:46.696
This is your payment ledger; payments are entered by you, not imported automatically from a bank.

5
00:00:46.696 --> 00:00:56.800
Writing off a balance is different from receiving money.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.000
Try it with your own records. Review the result.
